          </summary>
          <div class="border-t border-warm-200 px-6 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal-600">We see a lot of deck and patio builds, kitchen remodels, and room additions in the Burke area. We handle all of these along with new construction.</div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

